  <Placemark>
   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued September 12 at 12:03PM EDT until September 12 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Gaylord MI</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Highest gusts up to 25 kts from the southwest and
highest waves around 6 feet.

* WHERE...Seul Choix Point to 5NM West of Mackinac Bridge.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM EDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.</Snippet>
